desc(
	mode: "struct"
	language: "java"
	title: "Struct scan: Java ProcessBuilder"
	title_zh: "结构扫描：Java ProcessBuilder 调用"
	type: vuln
	level: high
	rule_id: "struct-java-process-builder"
	risk: "command-injection"
	desc: <<<DESC
### 规则说明
检测到 ProcessBuilder 构造或 command() 调用。参数若来自外部输入，可导致操作系统命令注入。

### 风险类型
command-injection

### 影响
该用法属于已知危险 API 或弱密码学原语，若处理外部数据或用于安全场景，可能导致命令执行、代码执行、反序列化或机密性破坏。

### 检测方式
结构扫描在编译单元内匹配真实调用，而不是注释或字符串字面量。
DESC
	solution: <<<SOLUTION
### 修复建议
使用参数列表而不是拼接命令字符串；对外部输入做白名单校验。
SOLUTION
	alert_min: 1
	"file://Run.java": <<<POS
class Run {
  void bad(String cmd) throws Exception {
    new ProcessBuilder(cmd).start();
  }
}
POS
	"safefile://RunSafe.java": <<<NEG
class RunSafe {
  void ok() {
    System.out.println("no process");
  }
}
NEG
)

ProcessBuilder(* as $cmd) as $call
ProcessBuilder.command(* as $cmd) as $call
alert $call for {
	level: "high",
	title: "ProcessBuilder Call",
	title_zh: "ProcessBuilder 调用",
	message: "结构扫描：Java ProcessBuilder 调用",
	risk: "command-injection",
}
